    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u15x](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u15x) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Oct 09 2026 2km N of Loltong. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.5361 longitude 168.1451. It impacted 16716 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
